  "notes": "UwUNotes now wears the new UwU Suite design ✧\n\n- **New suite design:** buttons, switches, choices and dialogs look like the other UwU apps, with round pill buttons and softer dialogs\n- **New icons:** clear Lucide icons everywhere, the same as in UwUMail and the rest of the suite\n- **UwU Console as an editor font:** the suite's new monospace font, easy to read and without ligatures, to pick next to JetBrains Mono and Fira Code (Settings → Font). JetBrains Mono stays the default\n- **High contrast:** a new setting under Appearance → Contrast (System, Normal, High), for light and dark\n- **Interface font:** UwU Sans now comes from the suite package; Manrope, Rubik, DM Sans and the system font are there too\n- **`:3` and `<3` stay as you type them:** they are no longer turned into symbols\n- The font licences are listed under \"About UwUNotes\"",
